      "content": "sometimes i look at the sunset and i don't feel hope, i just feel like it's a beautiful way for something to end. there's a certain dignity in knowing when your time is done, isn't there? instead of just fighting and fighting until you're completely broken and unrecognizable. it would be so much more peaceful to just... let go while there's still some grace left.",
